<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Christian Dior. [CORRECTED 16:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Christian Dior. [CORRECTED 16:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA New York has issued two million call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Christian Dior stock, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE    ISS PRICE  PREMIUM     GEARING  MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    1,000.0   6.07 FRF   19.72 PCT   14.6 X   18.MAR.98</p>
<p>(Corrects maturity date of tranche A from 18.MAR.97.)</p>
<p> CALL B    1,150.0   8.14 FRF   38.98 PCT   10.9 X   18.SEP.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE 17.FEB.97	 LISTING PARIS	 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  886.0</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
